%% @kicker Documentation placement
%% @alt Documentation placement decision tree. If no external reader needs the information, keep it internal when an operator needs it or contains private context, otherwise review whether the page has a task. If an external reader needs it, split it into a public task page and a private record when private context remains, otherwise publish it externally.
%% @caption Each path ends in internal, review, split, or external documentation. A split is two documents with one contract between them, not a redacted internal page.
